        <enumvalue id="classthemis_1_1storage_1_1_tensor_router_1a865469cca0153a7ad18915f385b6e090aeddfb2a2864a735ae508076a555c5075" prot="public">
          <name>HNSW</name>
          <initializer>= 2</initializer>
          <briefdescription>
<para>Standard vector index (no TT layer). </para>
          </briefdescription>
          <detaileddescription>
          </detaileddescription>
        </enumvalue>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Routing result for index-creation time (no tensor data available). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Used by <computeroutput>TensorIndexManager::routeFor()</computeroutput> which decides the index type for a (tenant, collection, field) triple before any vectors are stored. Values map to <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1storage_1ab7cb28745b37f08ef3a113f9a7e10cda" kindref="member">TensorRouteDecision</ref></computeroutput> as follows: TENSOR_TRAIN ↔ LIFT — full TT compression HYBRID ↔ HYBRID — TT shadow + native storage HNSW ↔ KEEP — standard vector index only </para>
        </detaileddescription>
