      <memberdef kind="function" id="classthemis_1_1storage_1_1_tensor_router_1a6c260c34d32a7ba5e0345261934a51d9" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>void</type>
        <definition>void themis::storage::TensorRouter::setTemplateCatalog</definition>
        <argsstring>(std::shared_ptr&lt; tensor::TemplateCatalog &gt; catalog)</argsstring>
        <name>setTemplateCatalog</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::storage::TensorRouter::setTemplateCatalog</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>std::shared_ptr&lt; tensor::TemplateCatalog &gt;</type>
          <declname>catalog</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Wire a TemplateCatalog for domain-tag-based routing promotion. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Set Template Catalog.</para>
<para>When a non-null catalog is set, <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1storage_1_1_tensor_router_1a340b1be6024c8b84aef2ded3bb8909c6" kindref="member">route()</ref></computeroutput> checks the catalog for a matching template whenever <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1storage_1_1_tensor_route_hint_1ae3095690d86d955c56baaf837f28f84d" kindref="member">TensorRouteHint::domain_tag</ref></computeroutput> is non-empty. On a catalog hit the router first validates the template topology via <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1storage_1_1_tensor_router_1a82ede97a2624c1114678f89435e09750" kindref="member">validateTemplate()</ref></computeroutput>. Only a compatible template (validation succeeds) and a successfully applied callback (returns <computeroutput>true</computeroutput>) promote the decision to LIFT. If validation fails, the callback is skipped and the router falls back to the pilot-based heuristic with a warning log entry.</para>
<para>Passing nullptr disables template-catalog lookups (default).</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">catalog</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Input parameter. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
